<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-72] Prepare parquet-format for Apache release</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-72</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Need to prepare the parquet source for release. We&apos;re planning on two releases:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;2.2.0 as com.twitter:parquet-format&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;2.3.0 as org.apache.parquet:parquet-format&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;2.3.0 will be identical to 2.2.0 other than changing the parquet packages to org.apache.parquet and updating the coordinate.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For both releases, we need to go through the &lt;a href=&quot;http://incubator.apache.org/guides/releasemanagement.html#check-list&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Incubator checklist&lt;/a&gt; and follow steps for &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.apache.org/dev/publishing-maven-artifacts.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;publishing maven artifacts&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12733853">PARQUET-72</key>
