                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14095999" author="rdblue" created="Wed, 13 Aug 2014 19:40:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve added &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-format/pull/6&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;PR #6&lt;/a&gt; with most of the changes required by the Incubator release checklist. We still need to:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. Determine how the last com.twitter release should be done &amp;#8211; probably using Apache infrastructure.&lt;br/&gt;
2. Reconfigure the POM file for Apache release infrastructure (for 2.3.0 if not 2.2.0)&lt;br/&gt;
3. Get release managers&apos; keys added to the KEYS file and signed by other RMs&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For #3, we should sign keys at Monday&apos;s hangout?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14096016" author="rdblue" created="Wed, 13 Aug 2014 19:56:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The PR adds license headers to quite a few docs files that should probably be on parquet.incubator.apache.org. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=julienledem&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;julienledem&quot;&gt;julienledem&lt;/a&gt; do you know where that site lives so we can move the docs there? Then we wouldn&apos;t need to keep them in two places. Plus, the site currently points back to the Parquet/parquet-format github pages for things like logical types.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14096019" author="jfarrell" created="Wed, 13 Aug 2014 20:00:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rdblue&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rdblue&quot;&gt;rdblue&lt;/a&gt; site is at &lt;a href=&quot;https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/incubator/parquet/site/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/incubator/parquet/site/&lt;/a&gt; , site can pull in the docs from the source if needed so we can keep them there and have them auto update when generating the website for updates (thats now I set it up for Mesos and Aurora)&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14119016" author="julienledem" created="Wed, 3 Sep 2014 00:10:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Issue resolved by pull request 6&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-format/pull/6&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-format/pull/6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14119062" author="julienledem" created="Wed, 3 Sep 2014 00:34:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;oops. I merged the pull request, but this is not the entire ticket.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14120410" author="julienledem" created="Wed, 3 Sep 2014 20:42:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Issue resolved by pull request 11&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-format/pull/11&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-parquet-format/pull/11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17857035" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:26:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-format/issues/262&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #262&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
